      "value": "I've been frustrated by the new interface as well, but also there's a lot of information that doesn't need to be there front and center.  Your version is far better than how it looks now, but in my opinion there's still more information than there used to be/needs to be at a quick glance.\n\nUsers want to be able to open a new instance quickly, and any setting getting in the way of that is going to irritate them.\n\nI think a better design would be to have the two basic settings you need front and center: Name of the instance, privacy setting of the instance.  But then under that, have a 'more options' button that expands out to provide all the additional settings such as provided in your UI suggestion.",
