      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Words like \"common functionality\" and \"user flow\" seem to be forbidden behind the doors at VRChat Inc. I'm getting so sick of UI updates that not only make the experience worse but also make me have to re-learn UI menus that I have gotten used to since the last time they changed them. I like what you have proposed as it retains much of the UI elements of the previous menu while introducing the new features added in the current updated menu.",
